      "attestations": [
        {
          "text": "CHAO Shih-lin 趙士麟 (T. 麟伯, H. 玉峯), Apr. 30, 1629–1699, June 5, official, was a native of Ho-yang, Yunnan. He became a chin-shih in 1664 and thereupon was made police magistrate of P'ing-yüan, Kweichow.",
